---
/**
 * Root Index — Locale Redirect Fallback
 *
 * Locale detection is handled at the Bunny CDN edge layer via Edge Rules
 * (OPE-726). The edge rules read Accept-Language and issue a 302 redirect
 * before this HTML is ever served to the browser.
 *
 * This page exists as an ultimate fallback only — it is served if edge rules
 * fail or are bypassed (e.g. direct storage access, edge rule misconfiguration).
 *
 * - meta http-equiv refresh: redirects to /en-GB/ after 0ms (bot/no-JS fallback)
 * - noscript links: manual locale selection for no-JS browsers
 * - noindex: prevents this redirect page from being indexed
 *
 * @see OPE-726 — Edge-level locale detection
 * @see DL-26 — Global access enabled 2026-02-11
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Open HR — Redirecting</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Open HR — The HR infrastructure of tomorrow. Redirecting to your language." />

    <!-- SEO: hreflang for primary locales (fr + en-US) -->
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fr" href="https://open-hr.work/fr/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en-US" href="https://open-hr.work/en-US/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://open-hr.work/en-US/" />

    <!-- Fallback redirect for when edge rules are bypassed -->
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en-US/" />

    <!-- Prevent indexing this redirect page; localized pages are the canonical targets -->
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />

    <style>
      /* Hide everything — redirect should feel instant with no flash */
      body { display: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <noscript>
      <div style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; text-align: center; line-height: 1.6;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Open HR</h1>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Please select your language / Veuillez choisir votre langue:</p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
          <li style="margin: 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/fr/">Francais</a></li>
          <li style="margin: 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/en-GB/">English (UK)</a></li>
          <li style="margin: 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/en-US/">English (US)</a></li>
          <li style="margin: 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/de/">Deutsch</a></li>
          <li style="margin: 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/es/">Espanol</a></li>
          <li style="margin: 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/it/">Italiano</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </noscript>
  </body>
</html>
